From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: jetbee <7734987+jetbee@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Mon, 5 Oct 2026 02:57:39 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] No source-built sysroot libraries on a native arm64 host

The arm64 host uses the prebuilt std (its proc_macro goes with it); disable the
musl_arm64 sysroot libraries that were built from source.

Assisted-by: LLM
---
 Android.bp | 5 ++++-
 1 file changed, 4 insertions(+), 1 deletion(-)

diff --git a/Android.bp b/Android.bp
index 7813b69..a8d57c2 100644
--- a/Android.bp
+++ b/Android.bp
@@ -108,7 +108,10 @@ rust_defaults {
             enabled: false,
         },
         musl_arm64: {
-            enabled: true,
+            // Upstream builds the sysroot from source for an arm64 *cross* host.
+            // On a native arm64 build host the prebuilt std (linux-arm64) is used
+            // instead, so these must stay off to avoid duplicate core/std crates.
+            enabled: false,
         },
         windows: {
             enabled: true,
